{"id":"c0383e348990de99","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-1-consistency.md","title":"1-Consistency","display":"df-1-consistency — 1-Consistency","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-1-consistency","aliases":["90-df-1-consistency"],"display":"df-1-consistency — 1-Consistency","depends_on":["[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[88-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-1-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-1-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-1-consistency — 1-Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c61fe71286984490\" href=\"?note=c61fe71286984490\" title=\"90-df-isigma-hierarchy\">90-df-isigma-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>；这里只检验原算术语言的句子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models\\sigma\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models\\sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\sigma\">\\(\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\sigma\\)</span>，满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (arithmetical theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> (arithmetical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c61fe71286984490\" href=\"?note=c61fe71286984490\" title=\"90-df-isigma-hierarchy\">90-df-isigma-hierarchy</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> (1-consistency predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1\\text{-}consistency}\\ \\vdash\\\n1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\;\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\sigma\\rightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\sigma\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1\\text{-}consistency}\\ \\vdash\\\n1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\;\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\sigma\\rightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\sigma\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\">\\(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>是1-一致的</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>公式类（存在量词开始）</li>\n<li>1-一致性等价于：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>不证明假的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>句子</li>\n<li>对包含足够初等算术的通常理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性蕴含 1-一致性，1-一致性蕴含一致性（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"afba846451d1e711\" href=\"?note=afba846451d1e711\" title=\"90-df-omega-consistency\">90-df-omega-consistency</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本书以“没有假的可证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 算术句子”定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span>。其它文献在更弱基础上的不同同名约定不替换本谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-isigma-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"c61fe71286984490","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"tar